  "description": "gRPC transport binding and strongly typed client for Orleans.Lattice.Api.State. Exposes the read-only cluster state API (tree, view and tag-index discovery, tag-member scans, tree structure, entry scans, point reads, per-key history, scan cancellation, metrics snapshots, cluster information, dead letters, and the auth-scheme advertisement) as seventeen unary RPCs plus server-streaming change and metrics subscriptions, over a code-first, Orleans-serialized contract, with a pluggable authorization seam and a default-deny posture. Registered with AddLatticeStateApiGrpc(...) and mapped with MapLatticeStateApiGrpc().",
